    "Imported income can pay another operator, withdraw, or consolidate with ordinary payer notes without a public withdrawal/redeposit",
    "Payer reopen can select another operator view but requires the original income wallet unlocked and reattached before financial operations",
    "Named SQLite files retain strict permissions, ownership, hard-link and no-follow checks; an already unlinked old WAL/SHM descriptor is treated as absent using one metadata snapshot"
